### Listar projetos do usuário autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?pageSize=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar projeto por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar projeto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teste",
  "description": "Descrição do meu projeto"
}

### Adicionar usuário ao projeto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/addUser
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### Remove usuário do projeto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/removeUser
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": {{projectId}},
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}
